# MAKRAY
Makray is your Operational Intelligent System Navigator. Makray is a robot powered by AI, and in the world of Makray everybody is able to start any project from scratch while live updated with the most efficient system algorithm. Makray will redefine the http , as an universe of efficient datacenter energy production oriented. Mine vision!  
